## Choose Boarding Pass Page

<img src="Screenshots(airport)/ChoosingBoardingPassesPage.png" alt="page that lets you choose if you want a virtual or paper boarding pass" width = "300">

Use this screen to choose how you will receive your boarding
passes.
If you choose to have your boarding passes sent to your smart
phone, the boarding pass information will be sent to the smart
phone number in your frequent flier profile.
If you choose to have your boarding passes printed at the kiosk,
they will be printed immediately.
When you make your choice, you will automatically be taken to
the final check-in screen.

